{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkdLL8fbCeojUbjDZrSY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's what I'd tell my son.\n\n\"Listen, I opened a site called 'מקור'. With the numbers it already had in (10,000 ₪ up front and 500 ₪ a month), the cheapest place it showed was **פסגות**. The fund it put up was **'ילין לפידות מחקה S&P 500 (4D)'**. Next to it I saw 'דמי ניהול 0%', so it looks cheap. It said that after 10 years I'd be left with **86,492 ₪**, out of the 70,000 ₪ I'd put in. That's the number that stuck. But I'm only half sure. At 7% a year for ten years it should be about 70% more, and this is much less. I don't understand why. Maybe it's the word 'ריאליים'. Also, פסגות isn't my bank. לאומי is in second place with 83,396 ₪, so a bank I know is nearly the same. I won't do anything until you look at it with me.\"\n\n**What I looked at, in order**\n- The big heading 'איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד'.\n- The coloured buttons with the English letters. S&P 500 was already marked.\n- The boxes: 'סכום היום' 10,000, 'הפקדה חודשית' 500, 'תשואה בשנה' 7. I didn't touch the sliders.\n- The two cards: 'הבחירה שלכם · הזול' with 86,492 ₪, and next to it 86,449 ₪ with '−43 ₪'.\n- A coloured bar I didn't understand.\n- The list of banks: פסגות first, then לאומי, וואן זירו, הבינלאומי, הפועלים and so on. Further down the numbers get smaller, down to about 63,000.\n- At the bottom, the fund box with ילין לפידות.\n\nThere I stopped. It was the seventh screen and I was tired. I didn't read the long list of funds under it.\n\n**What I didn't understand**\n- 'ריאליים', 'דמי משמרת', 'נאמן 0.02%', 'קרן מחקה', 'מדד' (here it isn't the price index from the news), 'אין נתון', 'עסקת החלף', 'בלי נטרול מט\"ח'.\n- The English lines: 'iShares Core S&P 500 UCITS ETF', 'USD (Accumulating)', 'Interactive Brokers'.\n- The purple dotted lines under every number.\n- The \"−43\" in the second card, and the red in the bars of the lower banks. They frightened me a little.\n\n**What was hard**\n- The black background with grey writing is hard on my eyes. The small grey lines at the top of the bank list and 'הפס נחתך' I couldn't read properly.\n- The bar has colours that are close to each other. I couldn't tell which colour went with which word.\n\n**What I'd change**\n- Put one plain sentence at the top: \"if you put this much, you'll have this much, and that's after inflation.\"\n- Explain in Hebrew why it comes out so much less than 7% times ten.\n- Use a bright background and bigger letters."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1885,"cache_read_input_tokens":15418,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1885},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c4d957e5-e277-40d4-bc1a-101600aac593","uuid":"3f0dc367-ef7c-4ee2-a8d7-03946d9dc5e7","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:12:05.155Z","request_id":"req_011CgkdLKw1tUMCA2Vq82q25"}
